WEBVTT

1
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,450
Can't you just be lazy?

2
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:25,090
I said General Hong Ying

3
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,650
You're not interesting enough

4
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,770
They only arranged a small win for me

5
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,530
Only thirteen six-bottle beetles

6
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,820
Now all seven combat brigades are resting

7
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,360
I gave you the task despite the pressure

8
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,320
You still say I'm not interesting enough

9
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:43,230
You want something serious, okay?

10
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:44,780
There is a ruthless one here

11
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,980
There is a fighting beetle camp

12
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,140
There are six bottles of beetles in the camp.

13
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,860
Copy it if you have the guts

14
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:53,880
But I have to remind you

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,920
It's very close to the camp

16
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,760
Once there is any movement

17
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,360
There might be seven bottles

18
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:03,920
I even took over the eight-bottle Beetle support line.
